  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-4">
    <td>Group A streptococcal pharyngitis with fever, treated with amoxicillin and doubled hydrocortisone under the sick-day rules; resolved</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>J02.0</td><td>S — Synthetic intercurrent illness; not a historical claim.</td>
  </tr></tbody></table></text>

